{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600150/extras/Header.png?t=1745514042\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Co-Ape: Rise of the Monke \u2013 Two Minds, One Monkey!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this unique <strong>co-op climbing game</strong>, full control is in your and your friend\u2019s hands!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Control a single monkey as a duo!</strong> <br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Overcome challenging levels with unique mechanics and reach the top! </strong><br> <br> <br><strong> </strong><br> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600150/extras/Heights.gif?t=1745514042\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Single or Multiplayer Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play completely solo or share control with a friend!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>See Your Steam Friends' Latest Heights</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Track your friends' progress and challenge them to climb higher!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600150/extras/MonkeHeightScore.gif?t=1745514042\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Two Different Difficulty Modes</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Normal Mode:</strong> Checkpoints are active. The timer is disabled.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hardcore Mode:</strong> Checkpoints are disabled. The timer is active.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2714 In <strong>Hardcore Mode</strong>, your completion time is recorded on the <strong>leaderboard</strong> after every successful climb!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Steam Leaderboard</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Finish the game in Hardcore Mode to secure your place on the leaderboard!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Uniquely Designed Levels</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every level introduces new mechanics and obstacles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Climb to the top alone or with a friend, and reach the ultimate peak!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600150/extras/wishlist.gif?t=1745514042\" />  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3600150?t=1745514042","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600150/36780179596ad7284a79e865a4a117add9d11591/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745514042","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600150/94ab2c6ea24c911ecaea66d995916c9a34f2c5e9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745514042","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600150/94ab2c6ea24c911ecaea66d995916c9a34f2c5e9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745514042","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3600540,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600150/extras/Header.png?t=1745514042\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Co-Ape: Rise of the Monke \u2013 Two Minds, One Monkey!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this unique <strong>co-op climbing game</strong>, full control is in your and your friend\u2019s hands!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Control a single monkey as a duo!</strong> <br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Overcome challengin